
== static.mjs 
PASS no import or require
PASS no innerHTML, outerHTML, insertAdjacentHTML, document.write, eval, new Function
PASS one CSS string, one prefix, a two-class root rule
PASS every link goes through link(), which allows only http(s), mailto and tel, with rel=noopener
PASS no dark theme
PASS the design sheet block is current (design/embed.mjs --check)
PASS the pane gives renderNavigation and search for the shell, and no renderDetails
PASS no dct: predicates written (JSS finding 4; review 8)
PASS no SPARQL patches: existing files are written whole with If-Match and read back (JSS finding 5; review 1)
PASS every DELETE and PUT is behind the book-folder guard (review 2)
PASS default export has name, icon (data: URI), label, render, mintClass, mintNew
PASS shouldGetFocus with no store says no, without throwing

